{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1403097-goetic-influence-question","id":1403097,"title":"Goetic Influence Question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-07-16T07:33:43-07:00","id":1403097,"title":"Goetic Influence Question","content":"Is there a limit to what Goetic Influences can be? The book never specifies if Goetia can have more direct Influences like a spirit but, given that they're created within the minds of humanity, I'm not sure how much they can physically control the world.<br /> <br /> For example, if I am playing a Mastigos and I summon the Goetia of Thor, could it have the Electricity as an Influence and be able to throw lightning, or are would it be restricted to more metaphysical ideas that fit the stories of Thor such as Authority or Strength?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25869-jesterthemad","name":"JesterTheMad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-16T08:13:14-07:00","id":1403101,"title":"","content":"Goetia are the most liable to have highly specific Influences among invisible entities -- their singular Influence is generally going to be [The Thing This Thing Is] ([Rank]).<br /> <br /> Temenotic goetia are the stuff of archetype and ideology, whereas the Dreamtime is where one typically finds more concrete Influences; Thor is going to be a being of whatever stories he participates in, which will vary largely in the fact that there are multiple different Thors in the Temenos.<br /> <br /> Numina are where goetic superpowers usually live, and Thor is generally more a being that can do stuff with electricity than Electricity Itself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}